1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 30=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:46,312 --> 00:01:47,230
I want to take a bath.

7
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:17,280
It's cramped on the ship,
so I accidentally

8
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:19,910
bump into you.

9
00:02:25,368 --> 00:02:27,280
(Though I've never
seen reed down shoes,)

10
00:02:28,488 --> 00:02:30,040
(I've still fought with all my might)

11
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,360
(just to stay alive.)

12
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,840
Don't catch a chill.

13
00:02:50,630 --> 00:02:52,430
Lan... Lanxiang.

14
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,590
I... I'm seasick.

15
00:03:03,310 --> 00:03:04,430
I feel weak all over.

16
00:03:05,190 --> 00:03:07,000
I... I can't stand up.

17
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,680
I don't have any strength at all.

18
00:03:11,030 --> 00:03:11,800
I'm so dizzy.

19
00:03:14,190 --> 00:03:15,840
You get seasick?

20
00:03:19,190 --> 00:03:20,560
I've never been seasick before.

21
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,150
Maybe

22
00:03:24,216 --> 00:03:25,710
I didn't get enough rest last night.

23
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,800
Maybe you caught a chill.

24
00:03:41,150 --> 00:03:42,280
If you've caught a chill,

25
00:03:43,304 --> 00:03:44,710
you shouldn't soak in the bath.

26
00:03:47,630 --> 00:03:48,630
Go lie down in bed.

27
00:03:51,288 --> 00:03:52,870
Young Master has caught a chill.

28
00:03:53,176 --> 00:03:54,430
Make him a bowl of ginger tea.

29
00:04:05,752 --> 00:04:07,120
After you drink the ginger tea,

30
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:08,776
bundle up and work up a sweat.

31
00:04:08,792 --> 00:04:10,770
Once you sweat out the chill,
you'll feel better.

32
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:16,040
If you feel sleepy, get some rest.

33
00:04:18,430 --> 00:04:19,120
Lanxiang.

34
00:04:21,672 --> 00:04:23,416
Are you feeling unwell anywhere else?

35
00:04:25,270 --> 00:04:27,390
I'm fine. Don't worry.

36
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,310
I'm leaving.

37
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:45,190
It worked out by accident.

38
00:04:46,070 --> 00:04:47,510
At least she's not angry anymore.

39
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:57,830
(The Capital)

40
00:04:57,830 --> 00:05:01,630
By the Mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees.

41
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:06,360
The Shenji Battalion guards the capital
and stands ready for military campaigns.

42
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:11,070
It commands firearms,
the most vital weapons of war.

43
00:05:11,390 --> 00:05:13,750
Such responsibility
shall only be entrusted

44
00:05:13,870 --> 00:05:15,950
to men of proven ability
and mature judgment.

45
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:20,070
Lin Jinqi, you are a man
of exceptional talent,

46
00:05:20,070 --> 00:05:21,750
upright and incorruptible in conduct.

47
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:23,576
Your merits are well known to me.

48
00:05:23,608 --> 00:05:26,230
(Enduring Merit and Lasting Honor)
Therefore, I hereby promote you

49
00:05:26,248 --> 00:05:28,390
to Assistant Commander
of the Central Military Command

50
00:05:28,630 --> 00:05:31,600
and appoint you to jointly
oversee the Shenji Battalion.

51
00:05:31,950 --> 00:05:36,160
Devote yourself to public service
and lead your men with loyalty.

52
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:40,040
Maintain strict discipline and further
the work entrusted to you.

53
00:05:40,070 --> 00:05:44,000
Honor this imperial decree.
Obey with reverence.

54
00:05:47,750 --> 00:05:49,870
Mother, we're here.

55
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,190
Mother, come quickly.

56
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:57,160
It's beautiful.

57
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:58,390
Look how happy you are.

58
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:36,750
- First Madam! Young Lady!
- First Madam! Young Lady!

59
00:06:47,848 --> 00:06:50,504
- Young Master. Young Madam.
- Young Master. Young Madam.

60
00:06:56,870 --> 00:06:58,040
Xiulai is here!

61
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:58,920
Xiulai.

62
00:07:02,270 --> 00:07:03,120
Xiulai.

63
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:04,860
(Lin Xiulai)
Jinqi.

64
00:07:04,870 --> 00:07:06,270
(Daughter of Lin Changzheng's concubine,
Eldest Young Lady of the Lin family.)

65
00:07:06,270 --> 00:07:06,830
Aunt Lingxiao.

66
00:07:06,830 --> 00:07:08,600
(Lu Jian, Lin Xiulai's husband.)

67
00:07:10,488 --> 00:07:12,744
Ever since she heard
Jinqi and Aunt Lingxiao were coming,

68
00:07:12,950 --> 00:07:14,600
she's been waiting day and night.

69
00:07:15,070 --> 00:07:16,480
At last, you're finally here.

70
00:07:16,984 --> 00:07:18,720
The snow is heavy outside.
It's too cold.

71
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:20,920
Let's get inside
and catch up once we're warm.

72
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:24,360
Jian is right. Let's all go inside.

73
00:07:25,270 --> 00:07:27,600
Yes, let's get inside and warm up.

74
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:41,720
Lanxiang.

75
00:07:42,552 --> 00:07:43,656
Are you feeling unwell?

76
00:07:46,190 --> 00:07:47,510
Is this your residence?

77
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:51,040
Years ago,

78
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:52,800
when Grandfather
was Minister of Personnel,

79
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:54,360
he had a residence here.

80
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:57,430
But property in the capital
is extremely expensive.

81
00:07:57,848 --> 00:07:59,390
After Grandfather retired from office,

82
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:02,070
he had no choice
but to give up that residence.

83
00:08:04,776 --> 00:08:06,760
His Majesty recently
granted me this residence.

84
00:08:08,070 --> 00:08:09,390
Xiulai and Jian

85
00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:10,936
just finished getting it ready for us.

86
00:08:19,510 --> 00:08:21,480
Jinqi, let's go inside.

87
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:30,480
Let's go.

88
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:51,030
- First Madam. Young Lady.
- First Madam. Young Lady.

89
00:09:03,740 --> 00:09:07,860
♪Spring slips from
the branches once more♪

90
00:09:10,740 --> 00:09:14,780
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

91
00:09:16,584 --> 00:09:18,720
- First Madam. Young Lady.
- First Madam. Young Lady.

92
00:09:20,940 --> 00:09:23,620
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

93
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:26,780
♪Though all the world may fade♪

94
00:09:26,780 --> 00:09:29,180
♪Time rolls on
as countless lives rush by♪

95
00:09:29,768 --> 00:09:31,960
- First Madam. Young Lady.
- First Madam. Young Lady.

96
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:35,620
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

97
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:42,660
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

98
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:46,550
Jialan!

99
00:09:48,860 --> 00:09:51,500
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

100
00:09:55,390 --> 00:09:57,000
Jialan!

101
00:09:58,820 --> 00:10:02,700
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

102
00:10:04,150 --> 00:10:05,030
Jialan!

103
00:10:06,140 --> 00:10:09,780
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

104
00:10:09,780 --> 00:10:12,540
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

105
00:10:12,540 --> 00:10:16,740
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

106
00:10:16,740 --> 00:10:19,980
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

107
00:10:19,980 --> 00:10:23,700
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

108
00:10:23,700 --> 00:10:28,300
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

109
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,150
Aunt Lanxiang.

110
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:35,560
(Lu Yingzhi, daughter of Lin Xiulai)

111
00:10:41,550 --> 00:10:43,030
It's already the Hour of Si.

112
00:10:43,150 --> 00:10:45,360
Why haven't the Lin family arrived yet?

113
00:10:45,390 --> 00:10:46,080
Madam.

114
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:49,080
This is Young Lady's birthdate card.

115
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,320
And this other one...

116
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:52,870
(Does the Lin family)

117
00:10:53,656 --> 00:10:55,270
(intend to call off the engagement?)

118
00:10:56,030 --> 00:10:57,550
The Lin family has gone too far.

119
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:13,360
This is Xiulai's daughter, Yingzhi.

120
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:22,200
(Jialan is so thoughtful and attentive.)

121
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:25,150
(She's truly your daughter.)

122
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:26,760
(When it comes to being thoughtful,)

123
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,550
(how could we ever compare)

124
00:11:28,550 --> 00:11:30,510
(with Old Madam
and her countless clever ideas?)

125
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,510
(Old Madam taught us well.)

126
00:11:37,150 --> 00:11:39,390
(Tonight, we sisters
can chat by the fire.)

127
00:11:39,608 --> 00:11:40,960
(I guarantee you'll eat your fill.)

128
00:11:41,270 --> 00:11:44,550
(It's settled.
We'll see each other tonight.)

129
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,030
See you tonight.

130
00:11:52,260 --> 00:11:56,420
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

131
00:11:56,420 --> 00:11:59,540
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

132
00:11:59,860 --> 00:12:03,540
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

133
00:12:03,540 --> 00:12:06,220
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

134
00:12:07,750 --> 00:12:08,240
By the way,

135
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:09,790
Xiulai also has a son

136
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:10,510
named Jun.

137
00:12:11,150 --> 00:12:13,360
He should be at school today.

138
00:12:13,432 --> 00:12:14,670
You'll meet him another day.

139
00:12:14,670 --> 00:12:17,580
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

140
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:20,020
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

141
00:12:20,030 --> 00:12:20,630
Jinqi.

142
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:23,150
Aunt Lingxiao said
it's been a tiring journey,

143
00:12:23,390 --> 00:12:24,840
and Jinlan isn't very strong either,

144
00:12:24,910 --> 00:12:26,320
so she had Jinlan and Suhua

145
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:27,928
return to their courtyard to rest first.

146
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,270
Aunt Lingxiao and Xiuwan

147
00:12:29,270 --> 00:12:30,750
have also gone to wash up and rest.

148
00:12:31,150 --> 00:12:33,270
We can all catch up over dinner later.

149
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,576
That was thoughtful of Aunt Lingxiao.

150
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,960
We're all family.
No need for formalities.

151
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,600
We'll take you and Lanxiang
to your courtyard to rest.

152
00:12:40,910 --> 00:12:41,390
No need.

153
00:12:41,870 --> 00:12:42,750
I know the way.

154
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,200
Go tend to your own affairs.

155
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:45,670
Yingzhi.

156
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:47,030
Go on. Go find your father.

157
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:48,440
Come here.

158
00:12:56,150 --> 00:12:57,670
You don't even want me anymore?

159
00:12:58,030 --> 00:12:59,390
Do you like your uncle that much?

160
00:12:59,790 --> 00:13:01,960
Then how about becoming his daughter?

161
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:04,600
Come here, Yingzhi.

162
00:13:12,870 --> 00:13:14,600
I like you, too.

163
00:13:30,648 --> 00:13:33,112
Come help Young Madam
wash up and get some rest.

164
00:13:36,670 --> 00:13:37,360
Young Madam.

165
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:00,240
What are you standing there for?

166
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:01,600
Hurry and go with them.

167
00:14:03,390 --> 00:14:05,200
See if Jinqi's courtyard
is missing anything

168
00:14:05,656 --> 00:14:07,016
or if anything isn't to his liking.

169
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:09,368
Add whatever is needed
and fix whatever isn't right.

170
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:12,630
Maybe Jinqi wants

171
00:14:12,630 --> 00:14:13,910
some time alone with Lanxiang.

172
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:16,600
It wouldn't be right
for me to tag along.

173
00:14:30,390 --> 00:14:33,360
You and Jinqi
don't share the same mother.

174
00:14:34,216 --> 00:14:36,392
If you don't hurry up
and get on his good side,

175
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:38,440
how are you going to ask him
for an official post?

176
00:14:42,390 --> 00:14:45,510
I'm counting on you
to secure a good position

177
00:14:46,328 --> 00:14:48,056
and keep rising through the ranks.

178
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:54,790
Mother.

179
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:58,360
Don't worry.

180
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,360
Don't worry.

181
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:03,080
I'll go ask Jinqi right now.

182
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:04,200
I'll go now.

183
00:15:21,870 --> 00:15:24,120
Uncle Jinqi.

184
00:15:30,030 --> 00:15:31,120
Go get some rest, my lady.

185
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:33,270
I have a few more words
to say to Xiulai.

186
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:45,080
You're a mother yourself now.

187
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:47,200
Why are you still so flustered?

188
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,480
What if you fall
while carrying the child?

189
00:15:50,670 --> 00:15:51,670
You're right, Jinqi.

190
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:53,750
I was careless.

191
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:57,600
Did you come after me
because something happened?

192
00:16:03,750 --> 00:16:04,750
All these years,

193
00:16:04,792 --> 00:16:06,968
you've been married
and living alone in the capital,

194
00:16:07,270 --> 00:16:09,390
without any family
of your own to rely on.

195
00:16:10,510 --> 00:16:11,790
Now that I'm here in the capital,

196
00:16:12,510 --> 00:16:14,790
if you ever need anything, just tell me.

197
00:16:17,096 --> 00:16:19,480
My husband passed the provincial
examination at a young age,

198
00:16:19,500 --> 00:16:22,440
but he has repeatedly failed the
metropolitan examination over the years.

199
00:16:22,488 --> 00:16:24,130
If he takes a teaching post
under the usual system,

200
00:16:24,150 --> 00:16:25,510
his rank would
be below the official grades,

201
00:16:25,550 --> 00:16:26,790
with little chance of promotion.

202
00:16:27,288 --> 00:16:29,544
If he enters the Imperial Academy
to gain experience,

203
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:32,290
there's no telling when he'll finally
receive an official appointment.

204
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:36,840
What kind of position
does he have in mind?

205
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:42,840
My husband said

206
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:46,270
you're now highly trusted by His Majesty

207
00:16:46,696 --> 00:16:48,520
and in command of the Shenji Battalion.

208
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:50,790
The Five Military Commissions

209
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:53,200
would surely
show you some consideration.

210
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:56,390
Otherwise,

211
00:17:00,150 --> 00:17:01,480
the Ministry of War would also do.

212
00:17:05,944 --> 00:17:07,450
I've only just arrived in the capital,

213
00:17:07,832 --> 00:17:10,088
and there are still
many things I need to sort out.

214
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:13,160
Ask him to be patient a little longer.

215
00:17:13,790 --> 00:17:15,350
Once I've gotten everything in order,

216
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:16,680
I'll give him an answer.

217
00:17:19,550 --> 00:17:20,200
All right.

218
00:17:46,820 --> 00:17:49,380
♪A lone figure
wanders down the old lane♪

219
00:17:49,380 --> 00:17:52,220
♪The heart remembers
what time cannot erase♪

220
00:17:53,300 --> 00:17:57,500
♪One thought brings sorrow,
another dreams of brighter days♪

221
00:17:57,672 --> 00:17:59,976
Assaulting a free commoner
adds one degree to the penalty.

222
00:18:00,024 --> 00:18:02,440
For a relative in the lesser
mourning grade, add two degrees.

223
00:18:02,580 --> 00:18:04,900
♪Or what changes fate may bring♪

224
00:18:06,590 --> 00:18:07,400
Father.

225
00:18:09,528 --> 00:18:11,720
My copy of Direct Explanation
of the Laws and Decrees

226
00:18:11,830 --> 00:18:13,070
is missing its final volume.

227
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:15,510
Did you take it to read?

228
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:18,590
(In a few days,)

229
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:21,200
(invite the Lin family
over for a tea gathering)

230
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:23,640
so you can meet Jinqi.

231
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:26,000
Jialan is bright and eager to learn.

232
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:29,000
The Lin family is truly fortunate.

233
00:18:30,740 --> 00:18:33,340
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

234
00:18:36,110 --> 00:18:36,880
(Father.)

235
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:39,070
(Mother.)

236
00:18:41,550 --> 00:18:42,880
(Your unfilial daughter Jialan)

237
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:45,200
(has returned.)

238
00:18:52,300 --> 00:18:54,860
♪I walk through winding alleys♪

239
00:18:55,500 --> 00:18:57,820
♪And around weathered corridors♪

240
00:18:58,620 --> 00:19:03,060
♪One moment of peace
brings a little brightness♪

241
00:19:06,350 --> 00:19:07,720
(It's...)

242
00:19:10,680 --> 00:19:12,030
(not the same as before.)

243
00:19:12,030 --> 00:19:16,420
♪I only wish
for one gentle ray of light♪

244
00:19:17,220 --> 00:19:20,300
♪Step by step, page by page♪

245
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:23,260
♪The portrait of my youth takes shape♪

246
00:19:23,260 --> 00:19:29,500
♪Let every doubt and restless
turn be carried on the wind♪

247
00:19:29,860 --> 00:19:32,780
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

248
00:19:32,780 --> 00:19:35,860
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

249
00:19:35,860 --> 00:19:42,780
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

250
00:19:44,750 --> 00:19:46,350
This courtyard is meant for the elders.

251
00:19:48,960 --> 00:19:50,070
Why did you come here?

252
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:52,760
Didn't Butler Yang tell you
which courtyard we're staying in?

253
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:54,310
He did.

254
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:57,550
But Young Madam
said she liked this courtyard

255
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:58,590
and wanted to stay here.

256
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:04,310
Since Young Madam chose it,

257
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:05,830
she can stay here.

258
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:21,096
Do you really
dislike the capital that much?

259
00:20:21,590 --> 00:20:23,070
You've seemed distracted

260
00:20:23,110 --> 00:20:24,264
and unhappy this whole time.

261
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,070
Are you tired?

262
00:20:28,552 --> 00:20:29,750
I'll send for a physician.

263
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:31,350
Lin Jinqi.

264
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:41,550
What is it?

265
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:49,200
I want to stay in the bedroom.

266
00:20:53,350 --> 00:20:54,480
That's all?

267
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:55,640
All right.

268
00:20:55,864 --> 00:20:57,448
I'll stay in the side chamber.

269
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:12,750
Before,

270
00:21:13,256 --> 00:21:15,000
you drugged me with knockout drug.

271
00:21:15,096 --> 00:21:16,310
It wasn't knockout drug.

272
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,000
It was

273
00:21:18,550 --> 00:21:19,750
something to help you sleep.

274
00:21:22,310 --> 00:21:23,480
Do me a favor,

275
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:25,110
and we'll be even.

276
00:21:29,750 --> 00:21:30,880
Whatever it is,

277
00:21:31,680 --> 00:21:32,790
whenever you need me,

278
00:21:33,790 --> 00:21:35,160
all you have to do is ask.

279
00:21:38,750 --> 00:21:40,110
I'd like to borrow Jiugao.

280
00:21:40,776 --> 00:21:42,168
I need him to help me find someone.

281
00:21:52,270 --> 00:21:53,110
Get out here!

282
00:21:53,790 --> 00:21:54,920
You little whore!

283
00:21:55,550 --> 00:21:56,750
Just what I'd expect

284
00:21:56,750 --> 00:21:57,750
from a brothel girl.

285
00:21:58,790 --> 00:22:00,310
You do nothing but laze around all day.

286
00:22:00,590 --> 00:22:03,270
All you know is how to flirt
with those fox-like eyes of yours.

287
00:22:03,270 --> 00:22:05,240
Luring men into your bed, aren't you?

288
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:07,030
Get up!

289
00:22:10,240 --> 00:22:12,070
Open your eyes and take a good look!

290
00:22:12,136 --> 00:22:14,110
It's your man
who's been pestering me all day.

291
00:22:14,120 --> 00:22:16,670
You can't control your own man,
so you take your anger out on me.

292
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:18,360
If you've got the nerve,
go hit your man.

293
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:19,310
Go on, hit him!

294
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:21,400
Why are they fighting again?

295
00:22:30,110 --> 00:22:30,680
You...

296
00:22:39,550 --> 00:22:40,590
Lanxiang.

297
00:22:45,350 --> 00:22:46,310
Lanxiang.

298
00:22:50,660 --> 00:22:55,860
♪The wind scatters the clouds,
and rain turns to mud♪

299
00:22:57,110 --> 00:22:57,640
It's me.

300
00:22:59,240 --> 00:22:59,830
I'm sorry.

301
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:01,830
I'm late.

302
00:23:04,750 --> 00:23:05,160
No.

303
00:23:06,550 --> 00:23:07,240
You're not late.

304
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:09,550
Not at all.

305
00:23:10,500 --> 00:23:13,580
♪Pause, then rewind♪

306
00:23:16,790 --> 00:23:18,310
I knew you'd keep your word.

307
00:23:18,830 --> 00:23:20,750
I knew you'd come to save me.

308
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:24,550
(You have to escape Yangzhou
and return to Jinling.)

309
00:23:24,600 --> 00:23:26,456
(Don't let everything
I've done be in vain.)

310
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:27,480
(Wait for me.)

311
00:23:27,590 --> 00:23:29,350
(I'll come back and buy your freedom.)

312
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:31,030
(I promise I'll get you out.)

313
00:23:31,432 --> 00:23:32,110
(All right.)

314
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:33,830
(I'll wait for you.)

315
00:23:35,200 --> 00:23:36,640
(I'll wait for you to come save me.)

316
00:23:45,110 --> 00:23:46,000
Shopkeeper Qi.

317
00:23:46,680 --> 00:23:47,960
I'd like to buy Ji'er's freedom

318
00:23:47,960 --> 00:23:49,790
along with her maid Xiaopu's.

319
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:51,440
Please name your price.

320
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:55,920
She's only a woman.

321
00:23:55,944 --> 00:23:57,240
If you wish to take her with you,

322
00:23:57,350 --> 00:23:59,750
I'd gladly agree.

323
00:24:00,240 --> 00:24:01,070
But

324
00:24:01,310 --> 00:24:02,160
to tell you the truth,

325
00:24:02,350 --> 00:24:04,750
I'm only acting
on behalf of my employer.

326
00:24:05,110 --> 00:24:06,110
Lv's indenture

327
00:24:06,110 --> 00:24:07,920
has already been taken
by my employer's wife.

328
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:09,480
So Lv's true madam now

329
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:11,350
is my employer's wife.

330
00:24:12,584 --> 00:24:13,944
If it weren't for that,

331
00:24:14,350 --> 00:24:15,510
I would've sold

332
00:24:20,104 --> 00:24:20,960
that little whore...

333
00:24:21,550 --> 00:24:22,200
Lv long ago.

334
00:24:24,790 --> 00:24:26,200
Not long after I arrived here,

335
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:29,440
I heard Qi Sihai say
that his employer's wife had taken

336
00:24:29,440 --> 00:24:30,720
Xiaopu's indenture and mine,

337
00:24:31,480 --> 00:24:32,790
and had taken Xiaopu away as well.

338
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:34,000
It's all right.

339
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:35,640
We'll find his employer.

340
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:39,790
May I ask your employer's name

341
00:24:39,830 --> 00:24:40,830
and where he lives?

342
00:24:46,056 --> 00:24:47,640
My employer's wife left instructions.

343
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:50,350
(Invitation)
If Young Madam Lin came looking for Lv,

344
00:24:50,550 --> 00:24:53,350
I was to give her this invitation.

345
00:24:53,720 --> 00:24:54,920
My employer's surname is Dai.

346
00:24:54,930 --> 00:24:57,368
He serves as Minister of the Court
of Imperial Entertainments.

347
00:24:57,400 --> 00:24:58,480
(Zhao Xingtang's Invitation)

348
00:24:58,480 --> 00:25:00,200
My employer's wife is the granddaughter

349
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:01,880
of Senior Grand Secretary Zhao.

350
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:07,400
Zhao Xingtang?

351
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,830
Madam Dai sent
Young Madam an invitation.

352
00:25:18,070 --> 00:25:19,440
She's clearly up to no good.

353
00:25:20,110 --> 00:25:22,640
I'm afraid it won't be easy
to buy Ji'er's freedom.

354
00:25:25,220 --> 00:25:27,850
Young Master, you have to think
of something to help Young Madam.

355
00:25:27,860 --> 00:25:30,500
In the capital, Young Madam
doesn't know anyone.

356
00:25:30,536 --> 00:25:32,200
She might not only fail
to get Ji'er back,

357
00:25:32,232 --> 00:25:33,800
but end up at a serious disadvantage.

358
00:25:34,872 --> 00:25:36,984
That's exactly
what I'm trying to figure out.

359
00:25:39,110 --> 00:25:40,880
Young Master, think of a way

360
00:25:43,310 --> 00:25:45,110
to get Ji'er back.

361
00:25:48,350 --> 00:25:49,480
If Young Madam is pleased,

362
00:25:49,960 --> 00:25:52,350
she might even let you
move back into the bedroom.

363
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:55,350
Don't become

364
00:25:55,464 --> 00:25:57,110
as much of a chatterbox as Jiugao.

365
00:26:17,920 --> 00:26:20,070
Does this outfit

366
00:26:21,310 --> 00:26:22,200
make me look younger?

367
00:26:23,912 --> 00:26:25,200
You don't need to look younger.

368
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:27,550
You're already young, Young Master.

369
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:31,750
Bring me the mirror. Let me see.

370
00:26:32,200 --> 00:26:33,000
All right.

371
00:26:44,550 --> 00:26:47,000
Zhao Xingtang sent me
this invitation on purpose.

372
00:26:47,960 --> 00:26:49,240
She's mocking me

373
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:51,200
for claiming I couldn't read back then.

374
00:26:52,830 --> 00:26:54,920
Even if Young Madam
wasn't truthful back then,

375
00:26:55,032 --> 00:26:57,416
that's no reason for her
to hold a grudge against you.

376
00:27:01,310 --> 00:27:02,480
She must believe

377
00:27:02,490 --> 00:27:04,680
I was the one who exposed her
and caused her downfall.

378
00:27:05,400 --> 00:27:06,960
She must hate me deeply.

379
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:14,000
Then what can we do?

380
00:27:15,110 --> 00:27:16,830
Does that mean we can't get Ji'er back?

381
00:27:24,240 --> 00:27:25,310
I have a way

382
00:27:25,960 --> 00:27:26,960
to make Madam Dai

383
00:27:27,440 --> 00:27:28,350
send Ji'er back.

384
00:27:38,440 --> 00:27:39,590
I'd like to hear it.

385
00:27:41,030 --> 00:27:43,720
Zhao Xingtang craves wealth and power.

386
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:45,750
Now that she bears you a grudge,

387
00:27:46,240 --> 00:27:47,070
I'm afraid

388
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:48,790
even an exorbitant offer

389
00:27:49,310 --> 00:27:50,400
wouldn't make her agree.

390
00:27:51,110 --> 00:27:53,640
So we'll have to use status
to our advantage.

391
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:56,720
As the wife of a court official,

392
00:27:57,240 --> 00:27:59,270
you could send
the Empress a letter of thanks,

393
00:27:59,592 --> 00:28:01,128
stating that while you were in Jinling,

394
00:28:01,240 --> 00:28:02,960
His Majesty graciously saw justice done

395
00:28:02,970 --> 00:28:04,400
and bestowed a marriage upon you,

396
00:28:04,824 --> 00:28:06,590
and that now you've
arrived in the capital,

397
00:28:06,824 --> 00:28:08,400
you wish to express your gratitude.

398
00:28:10,240 --> 00:28:12,510
It may look like
a letter of thanks to the Empress,

399
00:28:12,640 --> 00:28:15,070
but His Majesty is sure to read it.

400
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:17,830
You're now highly favored
by His Majesty.

401
00:28:18,070 --> 00:28:20,000
He'll surely return the courtesy

402
00:28:21,110 --> 00:28:22,720
by finding some reason

403
00:28:23,070 --> 00:28:24,640
to have the Empress commend me.

404
00:28:24,968 --> 00:28:27,160
With an imperial decree
from the Empress to protect me,

405
00:28:27,350 --> 00:28:28,880
if I ask for Ji'er back,

406
00:28:29,200 --> 00:28:31,030
even if Zhao Xingtang refuses,

407
00:28:31,350 --> 00:28:33,200
Senior Grand Secretary Zhao
and Minister Dai

408
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:35,350
will make her send Ji'er back.

409
00:28:36,720 --> 00:28:37,350
Yuchan.

410
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:47,750
I can write it for you.

411
00:28:55,540 --> 00:28:59,660
(Xu respectfully bows in gratitude
for Your Majesty's grace.)

412
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:15,440
What?

413
00:29:15,800 --> 00:29:17,200
You want to write it yourself?

414
00:29:19,200 --> 00:29:20,240
This letter of thanks...

415
00:29:20,696 --> 00:29:21,830
I don't want to write it.

416
00:29:23,550 --> 00:29:24,110
Why?

417
00:29:25,640 --> 00:29:27,160
Don't you want to save Ji'er?

418
00:29:29,270 --> 00:29:30,720
I do want to save Ji'er,

419
00:29:32,480 --> 00:29:35,070
but don't do to others
what you wouldn't want done to you.

420
00:29:39,960 --> 00:29:40,750
What do you mean?

421
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:44,350
Please explain it clearly to me.

422
00:29:47,350 --> 00:29:48,750
You used an imperial decree

423
00:29:49,592 --> 00:29:51,510
to force my parents
to agree to our marriage

424
00:29:51,960 --> 00:29:53,070
and forced me to marry you.

425
00:29:54,310 --> 00:29:56,070
If I use the same method,

426
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:58,880
wouldn't that make me just like you?

427
00:30:06,590 --> 00:30:07,720
And what kind of person am I?

428
00:30:10,070 --> 00:30:11,270
You rely on power

429
00:30:12,510 --> 00:30:13,880
to take whatever you want by force.

430
00:30:34,640 --> 00:30:35,640
So in your heart,

431
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:38,830
only Han Liang

432
00:30:40,440 --> 00:30:42,030
is a true gentleman.

433
00:30:45,310 --> 00:30:47,110
What does Scholar Han
have to do with this?

434
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:49,400
What does any of this
have to do with Scholar Han, huh?

435
00:30:57,750 --> 00:31:00,110
Isn't it because
you still can't let go of him

436
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:08,160
that you resent me for using my power

437
00:31:11,400 --> 00:31:12,830
to take what I wanted by force?

438
00:31:17,272 --> 00:31:18,510
What are you trying to do?

439
00:31:19,550 --> 00:31:20,240
Move.

440
00:31:26,310 --> 00:31:27,110
Move.

441
00:31:29,480 --> 00:31:31,790
Move!

442
00:31:37,200 --> 00:31:38,000
Xu Lanxiang.

443
00:31:39,350 --> 00:31:40,920
You are already my lawfully wedded wife,

444
00:31:40,920 --> 00:31:42,920
married to me, Lin Fengtai,
with all due rites.

445
00:31:45,350 --> 00:31:47,070
You should put those thoughts

446
00:31:49,030 --> 00:31:50,350
out of your mind.

447
00:32:15,070 --> 00:32:15,960
If my parents

448
00:32:17,110 --> 00:32:19,350
held official rank
like Master and First Madam,

449
00:32:20,232 --> 00:32:23,130
even if they weren't high-ranking
officials of the second or third rank,

450
00:32:23,140 --> 00:32:25,160
but merely a fourth-rank
Prefectural Vice Governor

451
00:32:25,176 --> 00:32:26,530
or fifth-rank Assistant Governor,

452
00:32:27,030 --> 00:32:29,310
would you have married me
without even asking my parents

453
00:32:30,270 --> 00:32:31,590
or telling them beforehand?

454
00:32:35,030 --> 00:32:37,830
You think obtaining an imperial decree

455
00:32:38,720 --> 00:32:40,720
and marrying me properly as your wife

456
00:32:41,350 --> 00:32:43,000
shows me the greatest respect.

457
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:48,350
But if I were the daughter
of a Grand Secretary or Minister,

458
00:32:50,350 --> 00:32:51,920
would you still have done the same?

459
00:33:17,336 --> 00:33:20,216
Why is it that if I were the daughter
of a Grand Secretary or Minister,

460
00:33:20,880 --> 00:33:22,510
you would think

461
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:25,680
it's wrong to marry me by force
without asking my wishes,

462
00:33:27,550 --> 00:33:29,480
yet when it's me, you call it respect

463
00:33:30,440 --> 00:33:31,440
and an honor?

464
00:33:43,270 --> 00:33:44,830
If you disdain my method,

465
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:48,110
I'd like to see

466
00:33:48,750 --> 00:33:50,160
how you'll avoid relying on power

467
00:33:51,400 --> 00:33:53,510
and get your benefactor back

468
00:33:53,944 --> 00:33:56,160
from Senior
Grand Secretary Zhao's granddaughter,

469
00:33:57,310 --> 00:33:58,590
the wife of Minister Dai.

470
00:34:37,960 --> 00:34:39,320
Madam, this way, please.

471
00:34:54,020 --> 00:34:57,060
(Xiaofurong Troupe Theater, the Capital)

472
00:35:00,776 --> 00:35:02,456
I'd heard before
that here in the capital,

473
00:35:02,472 --> 00:35:04,710
you've made quite
a name for Southern Opera.

474
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:07,440
Now that I've seen you,
I know it's true.

475
00:35:07,512 --> 00:35:10,030
(Xiao Shunqing, performer of the Xiaofurong Troupe)
Our troupe leader is a disciple of Furong.

476
00:35:10,030 --> 00:35:12,590
No one in the capital
performs Southern Opera better.

477
00:35:14,000 --> 00:35:14,840
That's wonderful.

478
00:35:15,150 --> 00:35:16,590
Whenever I get homesick,

479
00:35:16,710 --> 00:35:18,250
I'll come here to see a performance.

480
00:35:18,280 --> 00:35:20,280
Of course. Madam, please have a seat.

481
00:35:30,400 --> 00:35:30,840
Please.

482
00:35:35,630 --> 00:35:37,070
We've found out everything

483
00:35:37,096 --> 00:35:38,536
you asked us to look into.

484
00:35:39,800 --> 00:35:41,710
Minister Dai was demoted two ranks

485
00:35:41,710 --> 00:35:42,800
because of his youngest son.

486
00:35:43,190 --> 00:35:44,550
But once the matter blew over,

487
00:35:44,550 --> 00:35:46,770
Senior Grand Secretary Zhao
helped him return to office

488
00:35:46,780 --> 00:35:49,368
and he was promoted to Minister
of the Court of Imperial Entertainments.

489
00:35:51,510 --> 00:35:52,510
What about Madam Dai?

490
00:35:54,728 --> 00:35:56,056
Minister Dai has four sons.

491
00:35:56,104 --> 00:35:58,392
His second and third sons
are posted outside the capital.

492
00:35:58,920 --> 00:36:00,670
Only his eldest son
remains in the capital,

493
00:36:00,680 --> 00:36:02,792
serving as Judicial Officer
of Shuntian Prefecture.

494
00:36:03,030 --> 00:36:05,000
He's more than ten years
older than Madam Dai.

495
00:36:05,440 --> 00:36:06,960
Now that Madam Dai runs the household,

496
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:09,448
his eldest son and daughter-in-law
are unhappy about it.

497
00:36:09,960 --> 00:36:12,400
Minister Dai may seem
to dote on Madam Dai,

498
00:36:12,630 --> 00:36:14,960
and he even lets her
manage the family's shops.

499
00:36:15,070 --> 00:36:16,550
But they married later in life

500
00:36:16,630 --> 00:36:17,840
and have no children together.

501
00:36:17,920 --> 00:36:19,816
How much genuine affection
could there be?

502
00:36:23,656 --> 00:36:25,510
The accountants
and shopkeepers in those shops

503
00:36:25,510 --> 00:36:26,872
are all members of the Dai family.

504
00:36:27,000 --> 00:36:29,880
Madam Dai merely
puts on a fine appearance

505
00:36:29,880 --> 00:36:31,070
for the outside world.

506
00:36:33,630 --> 00:36:34,590
Thank you for your help.

507
00:36:36,360 --> 00:36:37,190
Not at all.

508
00:36:37,510 --> 00:36:39,190
I'm also a grand-disciple of Furong.

509
00:36:39,230 --> 00:36:40,360
By helping you,

510
00:36:40,360 --> 00:36:42,400
I'm also showing my respect to Furong.

511
00:36:43,416 --> 00:36:45,960
Besides, Mister Lu wrote to us
personally with instructions.

512
00:36:46,480 --> 00:36:47,360
Our troupe leader said

513
00:36:47,440 --> 00:36:49,280
you need only ask
if you ever need our help.

514
00:36:52,190 --> 00:36:52,710
Yuchan.

515
00:36:54,840 --> 00:36:58,150
You said before that Zhao Xingtang,
before coming to the capital,

516
00:36:58,400 --> 00:37:00,550
wrote asking for Qingxiang back.

517
00:37:01,000 --> 00:37:02,904
Yes. Second Butler Yang said

518
00:37:02,936 --> 00:37:05,360
he and Qingxiang could no longer
live as husband and wife,

519
00:37:05,440 --> 00:37:07,030
so he readily wrote a divorce agreement

520
00:37:07,440 --> 00:37:09,920
and returned Qingxiang's
indenture to Zhao Xingtang.

521
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:14,070
Is something wrong?

522
00:37:20,400 --> 00:37:21,230
Nothing's wrong.

523
00:37:21,640 --> 00:37:22,936
It makes perfect sense.

524
00:37:27,190 --> 00:37:31,630
♪I must take my leave before you♪

525
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:33,960
Please have a seat, Madam.

526
00:37:34,190 --> 00:37:35,920
I'll go see
if our troupe leader is back.

527
00:37:36,760 --> 00:37:37,440
Go ahead.

528
00:37:43,440 --> 00:37:45,670
Zhao Xingtang
is overbearing and domineering.

529
00:37:45,760 --> 00:37:48,440
With Senior Grand Secretary Zhao
and Minister Dai backing her,

530
00:37:48,630 --> 00:37:50,320
and Ji'er's indenture in her hands,

531
00:37:51,280 --> 00:37:53,710
you've only just arrived in the capital

532
00:37:53,880 --> 00:37:56,030
and don't have much to work with.

533
00:37:57,150 --> 00:37:58,360
I've been thinking.

534
00:37:58,710 --> 00:38:00,800
Maybe we should
take Young Master's advice

535
00:38:01,190 --> 00:38:02,630
and use the Empress's influence

536
00:38:03,000 --> 00:38:04,840
to get Ji'er back as soon as possible.

537
00:38:06,550 --> 00:38:09,510
So you think there's nothing wrong
with using power against others?

538
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:14,360
I wouldn't call it that.

539
00:38:15,230 --> 00:38:17,510
Besides, doesn't everyone do the same?

540
00:38:17,760 --> 00:38:20,550
When you're in trouble and lack
the power to handle it yourself,

541
00:38:20,840 --> 00:38:22,480
you have no choice but to find a way

542
00:38:22,480 --> 00:38:24,070
to seek help from someone more powerful.

543
00:38:27,760 --> 00:38:30,360
Zhao Xingtang is unpredictable.

544
00:38:30,630 --> 00:38:31,880
If Ji'er remains in her hands,

545
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:33,608
the longer we wait,
the greater the risk.

546
00:38:33,670 --> 00:38:36,320
Who knows what else might happen?

547
00:38:43,230 --> 00:38:44,760
You have a point.

548
00:38:49,840 --> 00:38:51,630
Let's go to Minister Dai's residence now

549
00:38:51,630 --> 00:38:52,920
and get Ji'er back.

550
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:58,800
Young Madam.

551
00:39:01,660 --> 00:39:05,740
(Dai Residence, the Capital)

552
00:39:29,150 --> 00:39:31,150
Madam, Madam Lin is here.

553
00:39:32,110 --> 00:39:32,960
Madam Dai.

554
00:39:44,230 --> 00:39:45,400
Good!

555
00:39:45,480 --> 00:39:46,440
Impressive!

556
00:39:46,550 --> 00:39:48,360
Xingtang is getting better and better.

557
00:39:48,480 --> 00:39:49,960
Mother is really going to win.

558
00:39:54,030 --> 00:39:55,230
Lanxiang is here.

559
00:39:55,960 --> 00:39:57,320
Look at me.

560
00:39:57,710 --> 00:39:59,590
I didn't even recognize you at first.

561
00:40:00,360 --> 00:40:02,440
Clothes really do make the person.

562
00:40:03,360 --> 00:40:06,280
All dressed up like this,

563
00:40:06,480 --> 00:40:08,510
you really do look
like an official's wife.

564
00:40:12,670 --> 00:40:14,960
Madam Dai, it's been a long time.

565
00:40:25,150 --> 00:40:26,280
When I heard you were coming,

566
00:40:26,360 --> 00:40:28,880
I had the maids prepare the mallets

567
00:40:28,936 --> 00:40:30,968
so we could play chuiwan together.
[*Ancient Chinese golf]

568
00:40:31,320 --> 00:40:32,710
Luckily, Qingxiang reminded me

569
00:40:33,030 --> 00:40:35,480
that you don't know how to play.

570
00:40:38,408 --> 00:40:40,110
Xingtang, you're teasing people again.

571
00:40:40,110 --> 00:40:42,070
(Zhao Xingluo, Xie Zhao's wife, Zhao Xingtang's sister)
Every lady knows how to play chuiwan.

572
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:45,480
Come.

573
00:40:46,400 --> 00:40:47,280
Let me introduce

574
00:40:47,280 --> 00:40:48,960
this young lady to you all.

575
00:40:50,030 --> 00:40:52,320
You've all heard plenty about her.

576
00:40:52,488 --> 00:40:53,912
She's the one whose marriage

577
00:40:53,960 --> 00:40:56,392
was bestowed by His Majesty
after he ascended the throne.

578
00:40:56,420 --> 00:40:59,280
(Zhang Liu, wife of Chen Qi,
Commander of the Shenji Battalion)

579
00:40:59,280 --> 00:41:01,150
So you're
Assistant Commander Lin's wife.

580
00:41:02,328 --> 00:41:04,510
His Majesty has certainly
shown you great favor.

581
00:41:04,670 --> 00:41:07,150
(Yin Lan'e, Dai Rong's wife)
Just a touch of imperial favor

582
00:41:07,160 --> 00:41:08,440
can lift a sparrow onto a branch

583
00:41:08,920 --> 00:41:09,960
and turn it into a phoenix.

584
00:41:09,960 --> 00:41:11,760
No wonder Madam Lin can't play chuiwan.

585
00:41:12,230 --> 00:41:13,150
Xingtang,

586
00:41:13,480 --> 00:41:15,110
when Madam Lin served you,

587
00:41:15,110 --> 00:41:16,710
you should've taught her.

588
00:41:18,630 --> 00:41:19,550
My mistake.

589
00:41:20,110 --> 00:41:21,030
My mistake.

590
00:41:22,070 --> 00:41:23,230
You should get to know

591
00:41:23,230 --> 00:41:25,070
Madam Chen well.

592
00:41:25,320 --> 00:41:26,440
Her husband

593
00:41:26,670 --> 00:41:29,710
is Assistant Commander Lin's superior,
Deputy Commander Chen.

594
00:41:32,920 --> 00:41:35,000
Madam Chen, this is our first meeting.

595
00:41:35,208 --> 00:41:36,648
Please forgive my discourtesy.

596
00:41:38,280 --> 00:41:39,150
Not at all.

597
00:41:39,832 --> 00:41:41,880
Assistant Commander Lin
enjoys His Majesty's trust

598
00:41:41,890 --> 00:41:43,480
and has a bright future ahead.

599
00:41:43,960 --> 00:41:45,510
We're the ones who've been remiss.

600
00:41:46,510 --> 00:41:48,030
Though we're all in the capital,

601
00:41:48,230 --> 00:41:50,510
you've never paid
a visit to my residence.

602
00:41:51,688 --> 00:41:54,070
No wonder we didn't recognize
each other when we met.

603
00:41:55,710 --> 00:41:56,760
Madam Lin

604
00:41:57,510 --> 00:41:59,030
comes from humble origins, after all,

605
00:41:59,110 --> 00:42:00,710
so she doesn't know these rules yet.

606
00:42:01,480 --> 00:42:02,960
Madam Chen, you can teach her.

607
00:42:06,510 --> 00:42:07,710
It's all my fault.

608
00:42:10,320 --> 00:42:11,840
She once served as my maid.

609
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:14,710
Had I known she'd become
the madam of a household,

610
00:42:14,960 --> 00:42:16,440
I would've taught her properly

611
00:42:16,440 --> 00:42:18,550
how to manage
a household and conduct herself.

612
00:42:21,960 --> 00:42:23,110
I've only just arrived,

613
00:42:23,120 --> 00:42:25,360
so I truly don't know
the customs of the capital.

614
00:42:26,030 --> 00:42:27,320
After all, in Jinling,

615
00:42:27,440 --> 00:42:29,960
the wife of a disgraced criminal
like Fourth Madam Dai

616
00:42:30,072 --> 00:42:31,128
would never be invited by

617
00:42:31,190 --> 00:42:33,710
a Deputy Commander's
wife to play chuiwan.

618
00:42:37,496 --> 00:42:39,030
I'm suddenly feeling a little tired.

619
00:42:39,624 --> 00:42:41,110
I'd like to go rest for a while.

620
00:42:46,760 --> 00:42:48,710
You're quite good
at blaming others first.

621
00:42:49,030 --> 00:42:50,510
If it weren't for Lin Jinqi,

622
00:42:50,520 --> 00:42:52,500
how would Fourth Master
ever have been convicted?

623
00:42:52,520 --> 00:42:53,360
Fourth Madam Dai.

624
00:42:53,432 --> 00:42:55,560
Dai Rong took his own life
out of fear of punishment

625
00:42:55,608 --> 00:42:56,950
for colluding with the Wo pirates.

626
00:42:57,016 --> 00:42:58,440
What does it have to do with others?

627
00:42:58,440 --> 00:42:58,880
You...

628
00:42:59,630 --> 00:43:00,400
That's enough.

629
00:43:04,780 --> 00:43:07,460
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

630
00:43:10,440 --> 00:43:11,510
From now on,

631
00:43:12,710 --> 00:43:13,550
you're free.

632
00:43:21,840 --> 00:43:23,710
I'm free.

633
00:43:45,780 --> 00:43:49,900
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

634
00:43:52,740 --> 00:43:57,260
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

635
00:43:58,540 --> 00:44:02,460
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

636
00:44:03,140 --> 00:44:05,900
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

637
00:44:06,620 --> 00:44:08,940
♪Though all the world may fade♪

638
00:44:08,940 --> 00:44:12,020
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

639
00:44:13,540 --> 00:44:17,780
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

640
00:44:20,700 --> 00:44:24,860
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

641
00:44:26,660 --> 00:44:30,220
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

642
00:44:30,220 --> 00:44:33,780
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

643
00:44:34,580 --> 00:44:40,260
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

644
00:44:40,620 --> 00:44:44,940
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

645
00:44:45,300 --> 00:44:48,260
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

646
00:44:48,260 --> 00:44:52,020
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

647
00:44:52,020 --> 00:44:54,900
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

648
00:44:54,900 --> 00:44:58,980
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

649
00:44:58,980 --> 00:45:02,340
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

650
00:45:02,340 --> 00:45:06,100
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

651
00:45:06,100 --> 00:45:10,100
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

652
00:45:10,860 --> 00:45:15,020
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

653
00:45:15,020 --> 00:45:18,460
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

654
